{"unit_id":"TYEclipse__dsh-semver#feature-parse","repo":"TYEclipse/dsh-semver","commit":"40bdfdee2ee3a0f79c8083a185183e33a405c1e3","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-semver 的功能「版本解析」：解析完整的 SemVer 2.0.0 版本字符串并返回主次补丁号、预发布和构建标识；格式不合法时说明原因。 通过对应工具调用，输入版本号或范围表达式并返回结构化结果。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/tools.ts:148-180","src/semver.ts:396-415"]}
{"unit_id":"TYEclipse__dsh-semver#feature-range","repo":"TYEclipse/dsh-semver","commit":"40bdfdee2ee3a0f79c8083a185183e33a405c1e3","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-semver 的功能「范围匹配」：检查版本是否符合精确、比较符、caret、tilde、通配符、连字符及 AND/OR 组合范围，并处理预发布规则。 通过对应工具调用，输入版本号或范围表达式并返回结构化结果。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/tools.ts:255-285","src/semver.ts:396-415"]}
